examples.setup:
What does `leaves(root)` return for the tree H(D(B, F(E, G)), K(-, M(L, -)))?
```c
int leaves(node *p) {
  if (p == NULL) return 0;
  if (p->left == NULL && p->right == NULL) return 1;
  return leaves(p->left) + leaves(p->right);
}
```

What does the following program print for the same tree H(D(B, F(E, G)), K(-, M(L, -)))?
```c
int g(node *p) {
  if (p == NULL) return 0;
  int a = g(p->left);
  int b = g(p->right);
  printf("%d ", a + b + 1);
  return a + b + 1;
}
```

